OL,3,GNEWSAFarms focus on 'positive living
OL,4,Aconditions' for workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union says farms across the island
OL,7,Fare putting a "strong emphasis" on
OL,8,Fproviding "positive working and living
OL,9,Fconditions that encourage worker
OL,10,Fretention and return.
OL,12,FJersey Farmers Union said it is a
OL,13,F"fundamental" part of how the industry
OL,14,Foperates.
OL,16,FIt comes after hundreds of hazards were
OL,17,Freported following inspections.
OL,19,FThe standard of accommodation has been
OL,20,Fassessed after an inquest into the
OL,21,Fdeath of a Filipino farm worker, George
OL,22,FCastrudes.
